(   3. Back-to-Back Diode Shunt:) Tj
T*
(   - Two antiparallel diodes in series with resistor placed in parallel with feedback resistor Rf.) Tj
T*
(   - For small signals, diodes are OFF, maintaining Av > 3.0 to initiate oscillations.) Tj
T*
