T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Op-Amp Monostable Multivibrator \(One-Shot\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Stable State:) Tj
T*
(   - Circuit has ONE permanently stable quiescent state \(Vout = +Vsat\).) Tj
T*
